      "content": "[SCENE START]\n\n**INT. GRITTY DINER - NIGHT**\n\nDETECTIVE HAYES (50s, white, stiff suit) sits across from HECTOR (60s, Latino, worn jacket). The air is thick with stale coffee.\n\nHAYES\n(Leaning in slightly)\nHector, we just need to know who was moving through this block Tuesday night. Just a name.\n\nHECTOR\n(Calmly stirring his coffee, not meeting Hayes’ eyes)\nDetective, this block moves on its own schedule. You know how it is.\n\nHAYES\nI know how the law works. And the law needs to know what’s happening here.\n\nHECTOR\n(A slight, knowing pause)\nThe law is one thing. This neighborhood... it has its own ways of keeping things quiet.\n\nHAYES\n(A tight, patronizing smile)\nI’m sure you have a way to help us with that.\n\nHECTOR\n(Finally looking up, a flicker of challenge)\nWe’ll see what the morning brings.\n\n[SCENE END]",
